                        ],
                        "form": "die Schlawiner"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8a50f778-2f08-3ac1-8d1f-9db88c7006c3",
                        "entry_id": "583c3576-5248-3466-a7bc-b58ab7b55042",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Person, die – in positiver oder oft in negativ bewerteter Weise – mit ihrem Verhalten gewisse Grenzen überschreitet"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "affce1cd-de32-4f78-a372-586eef859b0e",
                                "sense_id": "8a50f778-2f08-3ac1-8d1f-9db88c7006c3",
                                "text": "Der Junge ist ein kleiner Schlawiner; man weiß nie, was er gerade im Schilde führt."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "803811ad-ab8c-4f9a-a829-1e65c952f432",
                                "sense_id": "8a50f778-2f08-3ac1-8d1f-9db88c7006c3",
                                "text": "„Kein Wunder, daß die Beerdigungsbruderschaft von Schlawinern als der »lebendigste Verein« in ganz Buenos Aires bezeichnet wurde!“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a8c21058-6846-4008-b8fe-c5d8151d577f",
                                "sense_id": "8a50f778-2f08-3ac1-8d1f-9db88c7006c3",
                                "text": "„Dieser Schlawiner hatte seinen Diebstahl einfach Volker in die Schuhe geschoben.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eb7b9efa-0910-4814-8b80-7565c3846370",
                                "sense_id": "8a50f778-2f08-3ac1-8d1f-9db88c7006c3",
                                "text": "„Nein, mit Schlawinern wollte der alte ehrsame Münchner Bürger nichts zu tun haben.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b9b88e6e-ffe4-4e04-9ab6-49b8f0c433ea",
                        "source_entry_id": "583c3576-5248-3466-a7bc-b58ab7b55042",
                        "source_sense_id": "8a50f778-2f08-3ac1-8d1f-9db88c7006c3",
                        "target_lang_word": "rascal",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "rascal",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3102f4c6-5900-352f-8710-ab62c234ef52",
                                        "entry_id": "ee503355-cc2b-3a57-b710-1e518070fbab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A dishonest person; a rogue, a scoundrel, a trickster."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89202b7f-76a0-405a-9fb8-9f03aa6a4c69",
                                                "sense_id": "3102f4c6-5900-352f-8710-ab62c234ef52",
                                                "text": "Tuc[ca]. […] Can thy Author doe it impudently enough? / Hiſt[rio]. O, I warrant you, Captaine: and ſpitefully inough too; he ha's one of the moſt ouerflowing villanous wits, in Rome. He will ſlander any man that breathes; If he diſguſt him. / Tucca. I'le know the poor, egregious, nitty Raſcall; and he haue ſuch commendable Qualities, I'le cheriſh him: […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "41761047-b687-44d3-98ac-f14a440092bc",
                                                "sense_id": "3102f4c6-5900-352f-8710-ab62c234ef52",
                                                "text": "And he smote Corinius on his shaven jowl with the dice box, calling him cheat and mangy rascal, whereupon Corinius drew forth a bodkin to smite him in the neck withal; […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "74a11f21-2358-35eb-aa85-6fe5fa486b17",
                                        "entry_id": "ee503355-cc2b-3a57-b710-1e518070fbab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sometimes diminutive: a cheeky person or creature; a troublemaker."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60571d97-fa9d-4f53-9682-36cf991a001c",
                                                "sense_id": "74a11f21-2358-35eb-aa85-6fe5fa486b17",
                                                "text": "That little rascal bit me!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c0693cd-3d0b-427f-ad82-c8749c037c6e",
                                                "sense_id": "74a11f21-2358-35eb-aa85-6fe5fa486b17",
                                                "text": "If you have deer in the area, you may have to put a fence around your garden to keep the rascals out."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "35bb5b80-7d40-3e04-aa65-a505b35e2cce",
                                        "entry_id": "ee503355-cc2b-3a57-b710-1e518070fbab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A member of a criminal gang."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Papua-New-Guinea"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
